# Python Lean Project

- Planner: `claude-trabajo` in the main checkout.
- Coder: `codex-primary` in its implementation worktree.
- Architect: `claude-personal`, started lazily for semantic design risk.
- Security reviewer: `claude-trabajo`, started lazily for security-sensitive work.
- Backend instances are authoritative; never switch accounts or providers as fallback.
- `swarmforge/project-agents.toml` is the specialist trust boundary.
- Runtime state stays under `.swarmforge/`; role worktrees stay under `.worktrees/`.
